() Tj T*
(PHARMARIDGE WEB — MAINTENANCE AND DEPLOYMENT GUIDE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Repository: `https://github.com/pharmaridge/web`) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Live site: `https://pharmaridge.github.io/web/`) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. One-time Windows / PowerShell / VS Code setup) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Install Git for Windows and VS Code. In PowerShell, configure your Git identity:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(git config --global user.name "Your Name") Tj T*
(git config --global user.email "you@example.com") Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Use the current GitHub SSH key. If the key is already registered with GitHub, test it:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ssh -T git@github.com) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A successful response normally says that GitHub authenticated you. Never paste a GitHub) Tj T*
(personal access token into the repository, a script, or a remote URL.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If a key has not been created yet:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C "you@example.com") Tj T*
(Get-Content $HOME\\.ssh\\id_ed25519.pub | Set-Clipboard) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Add the copied public key at GitHub: **Settings → SSH and GPG keys → New SSH key**.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Pull the current website over SSH) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Clone it once:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(cd $HOME\\Documents) Tj T*
(git clone git@github.com:pharmaridge/web.git) Tj T*
(cd .\\web) Tj T*
(code .) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
