() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If the folder already exists, switch to the deployed branch and pull safely:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(cd $HOME\\Documents\\web) Tj T*
(git remote set-url origin git@github.com:pharmaridge/web.git) Tj T*
(git switch main) Tj T*
(git pull --ff-only origin main) Tj T*
(code .) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Confirm the remote is using SSH:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(git remote -v) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It should show `git@github.com:pharmaridge/web.git` for fetch and push.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Make and preview a change in VS Code) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This is a static site. The main files are:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  • `index.html` — page content and structure) Tj T*
(  • `styles.css` — layout, responsive design, animation and visual styling) Tj T*
(  • `app.js` — carousels, admin drawer, client showcase and browser storage) Tj T*
(  • `assets/` — only the image assets used by the public site) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Run a local preview from the VS Code terminal:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(python -m http.server 4173) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Open `http://localhost:4173` in a browser. Stop the server with `Ctrl+C`.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Before committing, check the change:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(git status) Tj T*
(git diff) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Commit, push and redeploy) Tj T*
ET
