(  • Client logo upload) Tj T*
(  • Client story) Tj T*
(  • Removing client showcase entries) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(### Important production note) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Do not use the current browser-only admin for real customer, pricing or client data. Before) Tj T*
(launch, add a real authentication and backend service with:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  • Server-side sessions or a managed identity provider) Tj T*
(  • Password reset and MFA) Tj T*
(  • Role-based permissions) Tj T*
(  • Database-backed settings and client profiles) Tj T*
(  • Secure image storage) Tj T*
(  • Audit logs) Tj T*
(  • Server-side validation) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The current admin is suitable for design review and static-site demonstrations only.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Production admin portal) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The production admin portal is available at:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(https://pharmaridge.github.io/web/admin.html) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It is powered by Supabase and supports:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  • Email/password authentication) Tj T*
(  • Authenticated client management) Tj T*
(  • Client logo uploads to Supabase Storage) Tj T*
(  • Public client showcase publishing) Tj T*
(  • Client removal) Tj T*
(  • Row-level security policies) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(### Supabase setup) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Create a Supabase project.) Tj T*
(2. Run `supabase-schema.sql` in the Supabase SQL Editor.) Tj T*
(3. In Supabase Authentication, create the first admin user under **Authentication → Users**.) Tj T*
(4. In the GitHub repository, open **Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions**.) Tj T*
(5. Add these repository secrets:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co) Tj T*
(SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-public-anon-key) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
