() Tj T*
(The contact form stores each enquiry in Supabase table `inquiries` with:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  • Email) Tj T*
(  • Enquiry type) Tj T*
(  • Message) Tj T*
(  • Status \(`new`, `in_progress`, `resolved`, `archived`\)) Tj T*
(  • Created and updated timestamps) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Run `supabase-inquiries.sql` in Supabase SQL Editor. Then open the admin portal and choose) Tj T*
(**Enquiries**. Admins can review, change status or delete enquiries.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The public form does not expose private admin data. Visitors have insert-only access; only) Tj T*
(authenticated admins can read, update or delete the inbox. For email notifications, connect) Tj T*
(a Supabase Edge Function or an automation service such as Resend after the insert trigger.) Tj T*
ET
